abstract: >-
  Python software for searching for finite matrix-multiplication algorithms
  through numerical optimisation, exact coefficient reconstruction, and
  independent verification of bilinear identities.
keywords:
  - matrix multiplication
  - bilinear algorithms
  - numerical optimisation
  - exact reconstruction
  - exact verification
